{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46831","headline":"荆渚感怀寄僧达禅弟三首 三 · 齐己","name":"荆渚感怀寄僧达禅弟三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹤岭僧来细话君，依前高尚迹难羣。\n自抛南岳三生石，长傍西山数片云。\n丹访葛洪无旧竈，诗寻灵观有遗文。\n莫将离别爲相隔，心似虚空几处分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}